# Messages for billing.invoices: keyed JSON, no headers, and the LARGEST records in the demo.
#
# Two things this topic is here for.
#
# One: plenty of real producers set no headers at all, and the interface must not look broken when
# the header list is empty. payments.transactions makes that point too; this one makes it on a
# topic whose records are big enough that the JSON viewer has to scroll.
#
# Two: nested arrays several levels deep. An invoice has line items, each line item has a tax
# breakdown, and the whole thing has a totals block that repeats the same numbers a different way.
# A JSON tree that is three objects deep with an array in the middle is where a collapsing viewer
# either helps or gets in the way, and forty-field flat objects never show you which.
#mode: key-value

